COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.CREDITCARDFEETAXAMOUNT IS 'Taxes on credit card processing fee charged for cash portion';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.CURRENCYCODE IS 'Currency of transaction';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.CUSTOMERCOUNT IS 'Describes the count of distinct passengers that will benefit from the transaction, specific to the merchants offering multi-passenger product (ex. vacation package, bid-upgrades…)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.ENDLOCALDATESID IS 'Surrogate key of the reservation end date, can be joined with Dim_Date';
