COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.PARTNERCURRENCYOBTAINED IS 'Number of partner currencies/points received by a member who completed an Aeroplan points conversion.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.PNRSID IS 'Surrogate key of the PNR/reservation, can be joined with Dim_PNR';
