COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.PROMOCODEPOINTDISCOUNT IS 'Amount of points discounted using a promo coupon code';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.PROMOCOUPONHASHKEY IS 'Promo coupon/discount code applied on a booking by a member (hashkey), can be joined with the Fact_PromoCoupon. A code can be a marketing/campaign promo coupon code or an Elite non-air retail (NAR - eStore) or travel (NAT - Car & Hotel) discount code.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.PURCHASECURRENCYTYPE IS 'Form of payment (points, cash, or mixed)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.RECONCILIATIONFLAG IS 'Flag indicating if the transaction is ready to be reconciliated with the corresponging redemption invoice';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.REDEMPTIONEXPENSECADAMOUNT IS 'Net cost for Aeroplan';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.REFERRALFEEPERCENT IS 'Percentage of referral fee';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.RULEID IS 'Redemption points pricing rule applied, driven by the Redemption Pricing Tool';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.STARTLOCALDATESID IS 'Surrogate key of the reservation start date, can be joined with Dim_Date';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.STARTLOCALDATETIME IS 'Start date and time of a car rental or hotel booking (timezone of the rental location)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.SUPPLIERCONFIRMATIONNUMBER IS 'Internal Booking reference number from supplier/partner';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.TOTALCOSTCADAMOUNT IS 'Amount to be paid by Aeroplan to the redemption partner';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.TOTALREFERRALCADAMOUNT IS 'Amount to be paid to Aeroplan';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.TRANSACTIONCOUNT IS 'Indicates 1 in case of a booking transaction, -1 in case of refund and 0 in case of cancellation.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_BOOKINGNONAIR.TRANSACTIONTYPE IS 'Type of transaction: booking, cancel or refund';




COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.COMPANYSID IS 'Surrogate key, can be joined with Dim_Company';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.MEMBERSID IS 'Surrogate key, can be joined with Dim_Member';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.PRIMARYAUTHORIZATIONSID IS 'Surrogate key, can be joined with Dim_Authorization';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.PROGRAMSID IS 'Surrogate key, can be joined with Dim_Program';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.TRANSACTIONGMTDATESID IS 'Date surrogate key for the transaction date (GMT), can be joined with Dim_Date';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.AUTHORIZATIONID IS 'Unique identifier for the redemption transaction, issued by the loyalty payment platform (LPP)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.AUTHORIZATIONGMTDATETIME IS 'Timestamp when authorization was issued (GMT)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.CERTIFICATENUMBER IS 'Unique certificate number issued to the member';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.ISSUEGMTDATETIME IS 'Timestamp when the certificate was issued (GMT)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.CANCELLATIONGMTDATETIME IS 'Timestamp when the certificate was cancelled (GMT), if applicable';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.CAPTUREDAMOUNT IS 'Monetary amount captured/settled for the redemption';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.REWARDPOINTAMOUNT IS 'Number of reward points redeemed';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.ACTIVITYNUMBER IS "Unique identifier for the member's activity, issued by the loyalty points bank (iFly)";
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.AGENTID IS 'ID of the agent or channel processing the redemption';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.TRANSACTIONGMTDATETIME IS 'Latest transaction timestamp (GMT) of the authorization, corresponds to IssueGMTDateTime or CancellationGMTDateTime if the Authorization is cancelled.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.AUTHORIZATIONSEQUENCENUMBER IS 'Sequence number to order different records for the same authorization, e.g. if the booking has a sequence number '1', then the refund could have a sequence number '2'';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.AUTHORIZATIONSTATUS IS 'Status description (Completed, Refunded, Partially Refunded)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.AUTHORIZATIONSTATUSID IS 'Status code identifier';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.MERCHANTID IS 'Identifier of the partner or system accepting the Aeroplan points redemption in exchange for goods, services, or flights';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.MERCHANTREFERENCEID IS 'Unique reservation/transaction identifier issued by the redemption partner';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.PREDECESSORAUTHORIZATIONID IS 'Previous authorization ID in the chain of authorizations';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.PURCHASECURRENCYTYPE IS 'Type of currency used by the member to obtain goods, services or flights from a redemption partner. The majority of redemptions present in the table are done using Aeroplan points (PTS). When eCredits (AC Wallet) are redeemed, the value will be the 3-letter code of the currency spent by the member. When Aeroplan benefits are used (like flight certificates or priority rewards), the value will correspond to the PointTypeCode of the benefit.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.REWARDCODE IS 'Code identifying the type of reward redeemed by the member (e.g. Flight, LCBO, eStore…)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.REWARDGROUP IS 'Category of the reward (e.g. F = Flights, R = Retail, N = Aeroplan benefits, O = Others)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.SUCCESSORAUTHORIZATIONID IS 'Next authorization ID in the chain of authorizations';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.RECONCILIATIONFLAG IS 'Flag indicating the record is ready to be reconciled against redemption post-booking and invoice information.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.MEMBERHASHKEY IS 'Hashkey of Aeroplan member number';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.FACTHASH IS 'Hash of fact record for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.CREATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'Batch ID that created the record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.UPDATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'Batch ID that last updated the record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_REDEMPTIONCERTIFICATE.UPDATETYPE IS 'Type of update operation (Insert, Update, etc.)';

